# The eight figures in docs/figures/ ARE committed on purpose: they are the
# figures the README shows, and a teaching repo whose pictures only exist after
# you run it teaches nobody who is reading it on GitHub. Everything below is
# genuinely regenerated.
*.png
!docs/figures/*.png

